<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>个人主页统计卡片 · GitHub / LeetCode / CSDN / 掘金 / B站</title>
  <meta name="description" content="一行 Markdown 把 GitHub、LeetCode、CSDN、掘金、哔哩哔哩的统计数据嵌进你的 README。">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/app.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header class="hero">
      <h1>个人主页统计卡片</h1>
      <p>一行 Markdown，把 GitHub、LeetCode、CSDN、掘金、哔哩哔哩的实时数据嵌进你的 README。卡片是 SVG，自动跟随仓库主题，不依赖前端脚本。</p>
    </header>

    <section class="gallery">
    <h2>卡片预览</h2>
    <div class="gallery-grid">
      <figure class="card">
        <figcaption>GitHub 统计</figcaption>
        <img src="http://[..]/github/lucky845?theme=light" alt="GitHub 统计示例卡片" height="200" loading="lazy">
        <div class="copy-row">
          <code id="code-0">![](http://[..]/github/lucky845?theme=light)</code>
          <button class="copy-btn" data-target="code-0" type="button">复制</button>
        </div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="card">
        <figcaption>LeetCode 统计</figcaption>
        <img src="http://[..]/leetcode/lucky845?theme=light&amp;cn=true" alt="LeetCode 统计示例卡片" height="200" loading="lazy">
        <div class="copy-row">
          <code id="code-1">![](http://[..]/leetcode/lucky845?theme=light&amp;cn=true)</code>
          <button class="copy-btn" data-target="code-1" type="button">复制</button>
        </div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="card">
        <figcaption>CSDN 统计</figcaption>
        <img src="http://[..]/csdn/testuser?theme=light" alt="CSDN 统计示例卡片" height="200" loading="lazy">
        <div class="copy-row">
          <code id="code-2">![](http://[..]/csdn/testuser?theme=light)</code>
          <button class="copy-btn" data-target="code-2" type="button">复制</button>
        </div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="card">
        <figcaption>掘金统计</figcaption>
        <img src="http://[..]/juejin/testuser?theme=light" alt="掘金统计示例卡片" height="200" loading="lazy">
        <div class="copy-row">
          <code id="code-3">![](http://[..]/juejin/testuser?theme=light)</code>
          <button class="copy-btn" data-target="code-3" type="button">复制</button>
        </div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="card">
        <figcaption>哔哩哔哩统计</figcaption>
        <img src="http://[..]/bilibili/89389361?theme=light" alt="哔哩哔哩统计示例卡片" height="200" loading="lazy">
        <div class="copy-row">
          <code id="code-4">![](http://[..]/bilibili/89389361?theme=light)</code>
          <button class="copy-btn" data-target="code-4" type="button">复制</button>
        </div>
      </figure></div>
  </section>

    <h2>参数</h2>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>参数</th><th>适用</th><th>取值</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>theme</code></td><td>全部</td><td>light / dark / github-dark-dimmed / transparent</td><td>配色方案，缺省用 light</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>cn</code></td><td>LeetCode</td><td><code>true</code></td><td>使用中国站 leetcode.cn 的数据</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>cacheSeconds</code></td><td>全部</td><td>整数秒</td><td>数据新鲜度与上游配额的权衡，越小更新越快</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>主题</h2>
    <div class="themes"><a class="theme-pill" href="?theme=light">light</a><a class="theme-pill" href="?theme=dark">dark</a><a class="theme-pill" href="?theme=github-dark-dimmed">github-dark-dimmed</a><a class="theme-pill" href="?theme=transparent">transparent</a></div>

    <h2>接口</h2>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>路径</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>/github/:username</code></td><td>仓库数、星标、关注者、访问量</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>/leetcode/:username</code></td><td>解题进度、三档难度、通过率、排名</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>/csdn/:userId</code></td><td>原创、粉丝、排名、总访问量</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>/juejin/:userId</code></td><td>文章、浏览、点赞、粉丝</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>/bilibili/:uid</code></td><td>粉丝、关注、获赞、播放</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>/health</code></td><td>服务与各平台数据源的健康状态</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p class="note">以上 JSON 端点统一返回 <code>{ code, msg, data }</code>，<code>code</code> 与 HTTP 状态码一致，原响应体下移进 <code>data</code>。<code>/metrics</code> 与 <code>/metrics/json</code> 是给抓取器的，不套信封。诊断端点（<code>/health</code>、<code>/livez</code>、<code>/stats</code> 等）一律 <code>Cache-Control: no-store</code>，响应体是当前读数而不是文档。</p>

    <footer>
      卡片数据来自各平台公开接口，按 <code>cacheSeconds</code> 缓存以避免触发上游限流。
    </footer>
  </div>
  <script src="/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
